# Local build/release index. There is no separate durable S3 archive for
# this service's template/params the way auth/server have (see this
# wrapper's own deploy.sh header comment) — this local snapshot IS the only
# historical copy, so never delete it if you might need rollback-full or
# rollback-config later. Never commit it — it's per-machine deploy history,
# not project source, and may carry real parameter values.
deploy-versions/
config-versions/
